  "description": "A header-only C++ template library providing a simple, convenient envelope-access model for thread-safe access to objects using reader-writer locks. Simplifies multi-threaded programming with automatic lock management and RAII semantics.",
  "iconFile": "docs\\Siddiq-Software-Avatar.png",
